  <data name="MC2_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Thanks for dropping by,[pause=10] but I'd prefer to be alone.[pause=0] Sorry.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MC2_002" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>...That isn't really my thing anymore.[pause=0] Find someone else to help you.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MC3_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>.........[pause=30]I see.[pause=0] At least there are adventurers like you two out there now.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MC3_002" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>...I don't really concern myself with that sort of stuff anymore.[pause=0] Please leave me be.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MC4_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>...It's been so long since...</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MC4_002" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>.........</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MC4_003" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>...Don't mind me.[pause=0] Enjoy yourselves on the expedition.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MC4_004" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>I've told her a hundred times to leave me in peace,[pause=10] but she's not getting it...</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MC4_005" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>You should come outside and see my mom's garden with me!</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MC4_006" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>There's all kinds of pretty flowers that would make you feel happy there!</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MC6_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>...Someone mentioned three famous names, earlier.[pause=0] I didn't ask more. I don't go where the noise is.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MC6_002" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>...I hope whatever they're doing doesn't reach this far down.[pause=0] It's quiet here. I like it quiet.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MC6_003" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>...It's dark here,[pause=10] but you get used to it.[pause=0] And it's quiet.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MC6_004" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>...A child, found safe.[pause=0] Someone passing through told me.[pause=0] ...Good. That's good.</value>
